================================================================================
Key Insights
================================================================================
1. BZ market prices show negative extrinsic values for deep ITM options
   (e.g., K=50: price=45.84, intrinsic=42.28, extrinsic=3.56)
2. This is inconsistent with Black-Scholes theory but matches
   futures-style margining where the premium is margined daily
3. The custom model attempts to capture this by adjusting the
   Black-76 price with a small factor that accounts for margining
